The idea: Launch coins that pay. Every buy and sell pays a tax from the tier the creator picks at launch. The coin's share of it lands in the coin's own escrow, and the creator picks a launch type for it: pay the creator, split it across a team, send it all to the coin's marketing, or pay the coin's holders every 10 minutes. Every coin also gets marketing from its escrow, whatever the type.

